Demon horns temporarily grow on your shield as you bash a foe with it for [144%, 163%, 177%, 189%, 200% (TL1-5)] damage.

If the attack hits the creature is impaled by the horns, causing it to bleed black blood for 50% of the damage done as darkness over 5 turns.

Any time you damage this foe in melee while it bleeds you get healed for [91, 119, 141, 160, 176 (TL1-5; SP 100)] (this can only happen once per turn).

The healing power increases with your spellpower.
